diagnostics/duplicate-method.em:4:10: `code` is already a field of `Badge`
      func code() {
           ^^^^
A field and a method cannot share a name, since `value.name` has to mean one of them. Rename one.
diagnostics/duplicate-method.em:10:10: `show` is already a method of `Badge`
      func show() {
           ^^^^
Emerald has no overloading. Give each method a name of its own.
